    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erubata Olaitoriani te nkop",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore tenelo niorikinono enkop aaya, entooriki Olaitoriani erubata teina kop metaa enkop sinyati. Intemat enkaina inkalifuni tikitam o imiet enkadoro; o ntemat enkaina inkalifuni tikitam endapasho, naa keaku sinyati te pooki nebaiki pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore teina kurma nedung'uni ewueji nerisioro inkaloli pooki oo ntemat enkaina iip imiet naaku ine wueji sinyati neeta intemat onom enkaina e wueji nemetii toki namanita ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore teina kop sinyati nirishu aoru erubata intemat nkalifuni tikitam o imiet te nkadoro o ntemat enkaina inkalifuni tomon te ndapasho, naa ninche ejing ina aji sinyati, ewueji sinyati oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keaku ninye esashati sinyati teina kop; naa keaku enelelo apolosak ooasisho tiatua ine wueji sinyati; nejing ine wueji sinyati aaisiai Olaitoriani; naa keaku ninye ewueji oo nkajijik enye, naa ewueji Sinyati te nkaraki ine wueji sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkae sashati, intemat e nkaina nkalifuni tikitam o imiet tenkadoro naa ntemat e nkaina nkalifuni tomon endapasho, naa keaku enoo le Lawi lelo ooisiaisho te nkaji e Nkai, pee eaku ewueji oo nkanas enye naamany.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore ake sii teina sashati natudung'uoki aitaa enkop nasinya, nidung'u aitaa ewueji e nkanasa, enkop oo ntemat nkalifuni imiet te ndapasho naa ntemat enkaina inkalifuni imiet te nkadoro neaku ene nkaji pooki e Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkop naaku eno lkitok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naa keaku eno lkitok enkop pooki natii nkaloli pokira ina kop sinyati o ine wueji e nkanasa, emanita ine wueji sinyati o ine wueji enkanasa, te nkalo oloontoluo o te nkalo o loosaen, eipirarete nkadoro nabo sashati olorere, nenyikaa eiteru te nkalo o loontoluo o meshomo oloo saen lo lpolosie leina kop. Keaku ina enkop enye te Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilkituaak laainei nemeitoki ae kata airony iltung'ana laainei; kake keisho ina aji e Israel menoto ina kop te risioroto oo loshon lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkitanapat naaipirta olkitok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: itaasa ingok, lo kituaak le Israel! Ewuang'ie enkikonya o enkitorogonyare, nimbalilie esipata o esinyatisho; entapal eyararoto oo ltung'ana laainei, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 19.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Entaa iloota intemat naasipa naaineneng'ishoreki, efa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "efa",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "entemet natemieki entapa",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nemetii emonkoi, o bati",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "bati",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "entemet natemieki entoki naruko anaa eilata",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nemetii emonkoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore efa tenebo e bati naa erisiori nabo, ore bati neeta ematua nabo e tomon e Homa, ore efa ematua nabo e tomon e Homa; neaku ore Homa ninye erikorieki enkiroishi pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore shekeli naa keaku ing'erai tikitam; ore shekeli imiet neaku shekeli imiet, ore shekeli tomon neaku shekeli tomon, ore mina ino neaku shekeli onom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ena ninye enkishooroto naa ninye intayu; ore ematua nabo e ile e efa te pooki homa e nkano e ematua nabo e ile e pooki homa e shairi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o erubata nauno e ilata, ematua nabo e tomon bati te pooki Kori (ore kori netiu anaa homa, eeta bati tomon); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore enker nabo te luaata oo nkerrai iip are, too lmarei pooki le Israel. Ena ninye enkishooroto te nkaraki olasar le ntapa, olasar opejori, o lasar le seriani, peyie itum aitobira olasar lo lning'o lo sotua te nkaraki ninche, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana pooki leina kop, neisho ena kishooroto ilo kitok otii atua Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keaku esiaai o lkitok peyie eitobir ilasarri oopejori, ilasarri le ntapa, o lasarri ooki, te lelo siruai, teina rishata nadoli olapa too sabatoni, o te lelo siruai pooki gelunot le nkaji e Israel: keitayu ninye ilasarri le ng'oki, o lasarri le ntapa, o lasarri oopejoro, o lasarri le seriani, peyie etum aitaiki olning'o lo sotua ina aji e Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isiruai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: ore to lapa le dukuya, te nkolong e dukuya o lapa, niyaya oloti oing'oni lemeeta entioto, nimpok ine wueji sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keya olapolosani oloti sarge lo lasar le ng'oki nepik ninye intaloishin e kutuk aji eina aji e Nkai, nepik sii inkedeta pokira ong'uan o lperere lo lasar, o ng'apeta e kishomi e ine wueji olgoriet liatua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niasiasa ina te nkolong e naapishana o lapa te pooki ng'ae otaasa eng'oki te ntorroni arashu te modai; metaa intayuyu olning'o lo sotua te nkaraki enkaji e Nkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
