                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 28.16-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore to lapa le dukuya, te nkolong e tomon oong'uan o lapa, naa ishipakinono ilo sirua le ngiroroto oji Pasaka ore too nkolong'i naapishana naa kenyae emukate neitu eisiujieki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore teina olong naa keitayu olkitok te nkaraki enkewan enye tenebo iltung'ana pooki leina kop oloti oing'oni te nkaraki olasar le ng'oki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nena olong'i naapishana e ilo sirua, naa keitaiki anaa olasar opejokini Olaitoriani iloing'ok ooti oopishana o lmeregeshi oopishana lemeeta entioto, te pooki olong e nena naapishana; o loro pooki olong te nkaraki olasar le ng'oki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keitayu anaa olasar le ntapa e efa te pooki oing'oni, e efa te pooki meregesh, o hini e ilata te pooki efa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
